OL,3,GNEWSAYoung carers 'hiding in plain
OL,4,Asight' - charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany children do not realise they are
OL,7,Fcarers because what they are doing has
OL,8,Fbecome normal for them, according to a
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,F"Young carers are everywhere," said
OL,12,FCathy Wood from My Time for Young
OL,13,FCarers. "Often they're hidden in plain
OL,14,Fsight."
OL,16,FWood - whose organisation is supported
OL,17,Fby BBC Children in Need - says one of
OL,18,Fthe "biggest myths" is that young
OL,19,Fcarers are "constantly doing physical
OL,20,Fchores".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
